'
  fishFullDescription: 'The Megalodon is a colossal prehistoric shark that dominated
    the oceans millions of years ago. It is believed to have been extinct for over
    3.6 million years, but legends  suggest otherwise. With a length of up to 18
    meters and serrated teeth the size of a human hand, the Megalodon is an apex
    predator with incredible power. '
